  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 692.03 Erroneously Paid Medical Assistance. Medical assistance which is erroneously paid on behalf of a client shall be subject to recovery if the erroneous payment is due to client error, withholding of information, or failure to comply with eligibility requirements.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #5171, eff 6-26-91; ss by #6531, INTERIM, eff 6-27-97, EXPIRES: 10-25-97; ss by #6614, eff 10-24-97; ss by #8417, eff 9-1-05; ss by #10384, eff 9-1-13; ss by #13756, eff 9-27-23",
